    },
    {
      "shot": 1,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "anna",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "清晨的鐘聲還沒響起，村子的風，已經帶來一絲……不尋常的氣息。",
      "tts_text": "[warm, friendly, cinematic but not announcer-like, subtle mystery near the end] 清晨的鐘聲還沒響起，村子的風，已經帶來一絲……不尋常的氣息。",
      "tts_text_note": "TTS-input-only delivery cue for the 2026-08-09 narrator refresh (Owner confirmed voice_id unchanged: Anna Su - Casual, Friendly and Bright / 9lHjugDhwqoxA5MhX0az). Canonical text/subtitle is unchanged.",
