      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot02_beat01_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 2,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "孩子，天亮了。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot02_beat01_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 2,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Morning, Shui.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot02_beat02_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 2,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "早啊，小水。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot02_beat02_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 4,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Look at that cloud.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot04_beat01_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 4,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "你看，那片雲。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot04_beat01_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 4,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "It's been sitting there for three days.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot04_beat02_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 4,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "它已經停在那裡三天了。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot04_beat02_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 4,
      "beat": 3,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "And... every day, it gets a little closer.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot04_beat03_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 4,
      "beat": 3,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "而且……每天都更近一點。",
      "tts_text": "[concerned, gentle warning] 而且……每天都更近一點。",
      "tts_text_note": "TTS-input-only delivery cue for the 2026-08-09 targeted regen (unnatural delivery fix). Canonical text/subtitle is unchanged.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot04_beat03_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 6,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "I don't know if I can do this...",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot06_beat01_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 6,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "我不知道自己行不行……",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot06_beat01_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 6,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "But I want to go see for myself.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot06_beat02_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 6,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "但我想去看看。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot06_beat02_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 8,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "If you want to leave the village, play one game with me first.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot08_beat01_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 8,
      "beat": 1,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "想出村，就先陪我下一局。",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot08_beat01_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 8,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Don't rush.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot08_beat02_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 8,
      "beat": 2,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "別急。",
      "tts_text": "[calm, clearly enunciated] 別急。",
      "tts_text_note": "TTS-input-only delivery cue for the 2026-08-09 targeted regen (unintelligible audio fix). Canonical text/subtitle is unchanged.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot08_beat02_zh-TW.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 8,
      "beat": 3,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "en",
      "text": "Look carefully. Then make your move.",
      "voice_id": null,
      "output_filename": "e10_z1_shot08_beat03_en.mp3"
    },
    {
      "shot": 8,
      "beat": 3,
      "phase": "PRE_PLAY",
      "speaker": "elder",
      "locale": "zh-TW",
      "text": "看清楚，再落子。",
      "voice_id": null,
